X:1
T:The Rocky Road to Dublin
C:Words: D. K. Gavan (c. 1860); tune traditional
S:Words after the Dubliners; melody: standard slip-jig setting, adapted to the words
N:Verse = A part twice (lines 1-4) + B part twice (lines 5-8); chorus after each verse
M:9/8
L:1/8
Q:3/8=120
K:Ador
P:Verse
